  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malaria Capacity Strengthening (MCAPS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this cooperative agreement is to improve the provision of quality malaria services by improving adherence to malaria service delivery protocols in targeted areas, strengthening the generation and use of malaria data, and increasing the capacity of the MOH and local stakeholders to plan and manage evidence-based malaria interventions at all levels of the health system.</narrative>
  </description>
